{
  "job_C16.6_20261117_222039": {
    "chunk_text": "Luna I qui inciderit difficile euadet se\u00fee afealla\u00f0 earfo\u00f0lice he \u00e6twint. Luna II, cito consurget ra\u00fee he arist. Luna III, non euadet he na \u00e6twint. Luna IIII, laboret et surget he swinc\u00f0 & arist. Luna V, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 & arist. Luna VI, non euadet he na \u00e6twint. Luna VII, medicina sanabitur mic l\u00e6cedome he bi\u00f0 gehelend. Luna VIII, diu languet et surget lange he adla\u00f0 & arist. Luna IX, languet he adla\u00f0. Luna X, diu egrotet lange he sicla\u00f0. Luna XI, periculo periclitat on fr\u00e6cnysse he dyrf\u00f0. Luna XII, surget he arist. Luna XIII, aliquod tempus egrotat sumne timan he sicla\u00f0. Luna XIIII, laborat et surget he swinc\u00f0 & arist. Luna XV, periclitat he dyrf\u00f0. Luna XVI, locum mutabit et surget stowe awent & he arist. Luna XVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 & arist. Luna XVIII, laborabit et surget he swinc\u00f0 & arist. Luna XIX, similiter ealswa. Luna XX, similiter ealswa. Luna XXI, rem adiuuabit \u00feinc he fultuma\u00f0. Luna XXII, languet et surget he adla\u00f0 & arist. Luna XXIII, similiter ealswa. Luna XXIIII, diu languet lange he adla\u00f0. Luna XXV, languet et morietur he adla\u00f0 & he swelt. Luna XXVI, languet he adla\u00f0. Luna XXVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 & arirst. Luna XXVIII, eger multum iacebit et morietur seoc swi\u00f0e he li\u00f0 & swelt. Luna XXIX, aeger euadet seoc \u00e6twint. Luna XXX, eger laborabit et surget seoc swinc\u00f0 & rist..",
